{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "\u6211\u7684\u684c\u5a18 My Girl",
    "steam_appid": 3634800,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your exclusive two-dimensional chatting companion is now online!</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a game featuring two-dimensional desktop pets and focusing on accompanying you in chatting. This game creates a virtual partner full of fun and warmth for you, so that you won't feel lonely in front of the computer anymore! This is not an ordinary desktop pet. It subverts the previous rigid, simple and dull experience. This is a partner with a soul. You can gradually build trust and reach into each other's innermost hearts! This game currently focuses on the chatting experience, and in the later stage, detailed experiences such as changing costumes and interaction will be gradually added.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>playing method</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Right click to call up menu</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press ESC to exit the cat teaser mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Currently, there are only two styles to switch between: gentle and irritable</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please do not use language that is not allowed by law towards her</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Currently, switching languages may cause a delay as the corresponding language model needs to be loaded</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your exclusive two-dimensional chatting companion is now online!</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a game featuring two-dimensional desktop pets and focusing on accompanying you in chatting. This game creates a virtual partner full of fun and warmth for you, so that you won't feel lonely in front of the computer anymore! This is not an ordinary desktop pet. It subverts the previous rigid, simple and dull experience. This is a partner with a soul. You can gradually build trust and reach into each other's innermost hearts! This game currently focuses on the chatting experience, and in the later stage, detailed experiences such as changing costumes and interaction will be gradually added.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>playing method</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Right click to call up menu</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press ESC to exit the cat teaser mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Currently, there are only two styles to switch between: gentle and irritable</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please do not use language that is not allowed by law towards her</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Currently, switching languages may cause a delay as the corresponding language model needs to be loaded</p>",
    "short_description": "Are you still staying up late and struggling alone in front of the computer? Bring this desktop pet home! This is a chatting partner with a soul. She has rich personality and emotions as well as extensive knowledge. Whether it's emotional value or professional value, she can offer it to you!",
    "supported_languages": "Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong>, English<strong>*</strong>, French<strong>*</strong>, German<strong>*</strong>, Russian<strong>*</strong>, Japanese<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
